+++ b/sdbuild/boot/meta-pynq/recipes-xrt/zocl/files/0001-zocl-support-32-bit-Zynq-7000.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@
+From: PYNQ snickerdoodle port
+Subject: [PATCH] zocl: support 32-bit Zynq-7000
+
+Zynq-7000 kernels have no AI Engine driver. Add the two stubs that the
+__NONE_PETALINUX__ AIE stub block was missing (frequency get/set), so zocl
+links without CONFIG_XILINX_AIE.
+
+The XRT error-code masks were unsigned long; on 32-bit ARM the module and
+class fields (shifted to bits 32-47) were truncated away. Make them 64-bit.
+
+diff --git a/src/runtime_src/core/edge/drm/zocl/include/zocl_aie.h b/src/runtime_src/core/edge/drm/zocl/include/zocl_aie.h
+index 8f98657..3a6fc28 100644
